# rpmlint 2.7 lacks a leading symbol boundary and matches ares_gethostbyname.
# Both OBS ELF files import c-ares; neither imports an obsolete libc resolver.
# Restrict the exception to the reviewed Python ABI, architectures and paths.
# One expression avoids an unused foreign-architecture filter in native lint.
# The backreference also rejects a package/library architecture mismatch.
addFilter(r'^python313-grpcio\.(?P<arch>x86_64|aarch64): W: binary-or-shlib-calls-gethostbyname /usr/lib64/python3\.13/site-packages/grpc/_cython/cygrpc\.cpython-313-(?P=arch)-linux-gnu\.so$')
